This folder contains the public C headers. Each module includes its owner's
header instead of reaching into another component's private source file.

## Ownership

- `entrance/` — Leon Nsitta
- `trevor/` — Kato Trevor
- `storage/` and `cli/` — Kagimu Edward
- `actuator/` — Ahurira Grace
- `common/` and `auth/` — shared integration contracts

Each subfolder has a short README. Shared interfaces and state ownership are
described in `docs/INTERFACES.md` and `docs/COMPONENT_OWNERSHIP.md`.
